1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,807
In 2018, SK hynix hit record earnings

2
00:00:03,827 --> 00:00:07,013
One year later, 87% of that profit vanished

3
00:00:07,033 --> 00:00:09,367
₩20.8 trillion became ₩2.7 trillion

4
00:00:09,387 --> 00:00:10,880
In just one year

5
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,218
A memory fab costs money even when idle

6
00:00:13,238 --> 00:00:16,813
So when prices dip even a little, profit drops in big chunks

7
00:00:16,833 --> 00:00:20,146
The interesting part: sales were still growing back then

8
00:00:20,166 --> 00:00:24,880
But the margin fell from 57% to 45% in a single quarter

9
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:25,919
So what about this year?

10
00:00:25,939 --> 00:00:27,568
It's not because they sold more

11
00:00:27,588 --> 00:00:29,340
Volume rose 9%,

12
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:31,413
but prices rose 30%

13
00:00:31,433 --> 00:00:34,690
So on October 28, watch just this one number

14
00:00:34,710 --> 00:00:38,147
Q2 operating margin was 76%. Does it start to bend?

15
00:00:38,167 --> 00:00:40,565
If sales keep growing but the margin bends first,

16
00:00:40,585 --> 00:00:43,413
that's the same warning light we saw in 2018

17
00:00:43,433 --> 00:00:46,077
The rest of the story is in the full video

18
00:00:46,097 --> 00:00:48,500
Tap the link below
